text:
tool: fetch_url
description: Perform one HTTP request from the review sandbox and return the observed status line, headers, and a bounded body excerpt.

input schema:
  type: object
  required: [url]
  properties:
    url:        { type: string, description: absolute https URL taken from the ticket }
    method:     { type: string, enum: [GET, POST], default: GET }
    headers:    { type: object, additionalProperties: { type: string } }
    timeout_ms: { type: integer, minimum: 100, maximum: 30000, default: 5000 }

output schema:
  type: object
  properties:
    status:       { type: integer }
    headers:      { type: object, additionalProperties: { type: string } }
    body_excerpt: { type: string, maxLength: 2048 }

notes:
  - The sandbox resolves DNS against a pinned allowlist; an unlisted host returns status 0.
  - body_excerpt is cut at 2048 characters and the cut is marked in-band.
  - Every call is logged with the exact URL, so a guessed URL is visible to the reviewer.
